    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Bow Save DC: 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Dexterity modifier</p><p><a href=\"https://amellwind-mh-dn-d5e-foundry-toolbox-2.vercel.app/weapons?weapon=Bow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Bow in the Toolbox</a></p><hr><h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature with this weapon and deal damage to it, the creature's Speed is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Coatings</strong></p><p>This weapon can apply specialized coatings that you purchase or craft as inventory items. You can apply only coating types unlocked for this weapon's rarity (and any lower rarity). Once on each of your turns (no action required), you can expend one coating vial you are carrying and make that coating your active coating. An active coating has 3 charges. It remains active until its charges are expended, you activate a different coating (any remaining charges on the previous coating are lost), or you finish a Short or Long Rest (any remaining charges are lost). When you make a ranged attack with this bow while a coating is active, one charge is expended and the coating's effect applies as described for that coating. You still expend ammunition (arrows) as normal for the attack. Coatings do not regenerate; new vials must be bought or crafted.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Charging Sidestep</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you leap up to 15 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks. If you make a ranged attack with this bow later on the same turn, that attack deals an extra [[/r 1d4]] piercing damage on a hit.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Dragonpiercer</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p><p>As an Action, you fire an arrow in a 30-foot line that is 5 feet wide. Each creature in that line must make a Dexterity saving throw against your Bow Save DC. A creature takes [[/r 4d6]] piercing damage on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, regaining all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">True Dragonpiercer</strong></p><p>Your Dragonpiercer damage becomes [[/r 6d6]]. The shot ignores half cover and three-quarters cover.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Tracer I</strong></p><p>When you hit a creature with a ranged attack using this bow, you gain 1 Tracer (maximum 3). All Tracer fades if you haven't made an attack with this bow for 1 minute. When you use Dragonpiercer, you can spend any number of Tracer. The shot deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] piercing damage for each Tracer spent.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Tracer II</strong></p><p>Your Tracer maximum becomes 5.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Tracer III</strong></p><p>Your Tracer maximum becomes 7.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Advanced Coatings</strong></p><p>You unlock Blast, Poison, Paralysis, and Sleep coatings.</p></div><h3>Coatings</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Power Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] piercing damage.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Power Coating Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Power Coating's extra damage becomes [[/r 2d6]] piercing.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Power Coating Upgrade II</strong></p><p>Your Power Coating's extra damage becomes [[/r 3d6]] piercing.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Close Range Coating</strong></p><p>You do not have Disadvantage on this ranged attack from a hostile creature within 5 feet of you. This coating expends a charge when you make the attack, hit or miss.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Acid Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] acid damage.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Acid Coating Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Acid Coating's extra damage becomes [[/r 2d6]] acid.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Cold Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] cold damage.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Cold Coating Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Cold Coating's extra damage becomes [[/r 2d6]] cold.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Fire Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] fire damage.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Fire Coating Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Fire Coating's extra damage becomes [[/r 2d6]] fire.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Lightning Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] lightning damage.</p><div style=\"margin:0.45em 0 0.1em 0.35em;padding:0.4em 0.55em;border-left:2px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:0 3px 3px 0\"><p>▸ Upgrade — <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Lightning Coating Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Lightning Coating's extra damage becomes [[/r 2d6]] lightning.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Blast Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, each other creature within 5 feet of the target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw against your Bow Save DC or take [[/r 1d8]] fire damage.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Poison Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d4]] poison damage, and the target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw against your Bow Save DC or have the Poisoned condition for 1 minute. The target can repeat the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the condition on a success.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Paralysis Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d4]] lightning damage, and the target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw against your Bow Save DC or have the Paralyzed condition until the end of its next turn. If the target succeeds on this save, it is immune to your Paralysis Coating for 24 hours.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Sleep Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw against your Bow Save DC or have the Unconscious condition for 1 minute, or until it takes damage or another creature uses an action to shake it awake. Constructs and Undead automatically succeed on the save.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<p>Bow Save DC: 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Dexterity modifier</p><hr><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Coatings</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Charging Sidestep</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Dragonpiercer</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">True Dragonpiercer</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #ff8000;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Tracer I</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Tracer II</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0.2em 0 0 0.35em\">▸ <strong style=\"color:#ff8000\">Tracer III</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #a335ee;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#a335ee\">Advanced Coatings</strong></p></div>"
    },
